## Interface: 16001
## Title: Social Shortcuts
## Notes: Modifier-click a player name anywhere to whisper, invite or add them as a friend.
## Author: miyanko
## Version: 2.0.0
## Category: Social
## IconTexture: Interface\Icons\UI_Chat
## SavedVariables: SocialShortcutsDB
## AddonCompartmentFunc: SocialShortcuts_CompartmentClick
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnEnter: SocialShortcuts_CompartmentEnter
## AddonCompartmentFuncOnLeave: SocialShortcuts_CompartmentLeave

# Load order is the dependency order: Config exports the binding lookup and the secret guard, Names a
# unit's name in Blizzard's own menu form, Actions the three things a binding can do, and Hooks wires the
# click surfaces to all of them. UI only reads what Config already set up.

Core\Config.lua
Core\Names.lua
Core\Actions.lua
Core\Hooks.lua
UI\Options.lua
